<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Anchor Wallace PO# {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c} Notice of Cancellation. SO# {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_Number__c}, {!relatedTo.ThreadID_FK__c}" 
recipientType="Contact"  relatedToType="case">

    <messaging:htmlEmailBody >

<html>

<span><img src="https://kooziegroup--c.documentforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0154w000024rRrQ&oid=00D1U000000oeAl&lastMod=1650037233000" title="Anchor Wallace Logo" /></span><br />
<br />

<p align="left" style="text-align:left"><b>Thanks for ordering from Anhcor Wallace!</b><br/><br/>All you need to do now is <b>click the link below</b> to review your proof.</p>

<p><b>We are still waiting on clarification regarding issues with your order and have not received a response. We hope to get this resolved soon, but if we don’t hear back from you within the next 24 hours, we will have to cancel this order.</b></p>

<p align="left" style="text-align:left">Please be advised that your order is <u><b>ON HOLD</b></u> until your proof is approved. Your order will remain on hold until you follow the link below, then click one of the proof approval options.</p>
    
    <p><b>PO Number:</b> {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c}&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>Order Number:</b> {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_ID__c}&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </p>

<p><b>You must follow the link below to view your proof and then click approved, approved with changes or not approved</b>. Please do not reply to this email. Replying to this email will not move your order into production.</p>

<p>
<br/><c:clarQuestions rcaseID="{!relatedTo}"/>
</p>

<p><b>If clicking this link results in an error, please copy and paste the address into your internet browser.</b></p>
     
    
    <p>This proof approval process allows you to clearly view proofs on any mobile device, print, download, email or save the proof as a PDF. Plus, with just two clicks your proof can be approved faster than ever before, and we will begin production as soon as we get your go-ahead. </p>
    


Please carefully review for the following:<br/>

<ul><li>Typographical Errors</li>
     <li>Valid Color Separation</li>
    <li>Correct Imprint Position and Size</li>
    <li>Correct Imprinting Colors</li>
    <li>Missing Type/Copy/Logos</li>
    <li>Correct Layout</li>
</ul>  


<p><b>Additional action needed for this order</b><br/>
<apex:outputText value="{!IF(AND(NOT(ISBLANK(relatedTo.Count_Open_Clarification_Questions__c)), 
relatedTo.Count_Open_Clarification_Questions__c > 0 && relatedTo.Count_Open_EProof_Questions__c > 0), relatedTo.Proof_Clar_Link_URL__c, '')}" escape="false"/><br/>

<br/>
</p>

______________________________________________________________________<br/>




<p>All the best, <br/>
Anchor Wallace Customer Care<br/></p>



<a href="https://www.anchorwallace.com/" style="text-decoration:none;color:#456FB2;font-size:18px;font-family:Source Sans Pro Black,sans-serif;">anchorwallace.com</a><br />
<span style="font-size:11px"><span style="color:black"><span style="line-height:.7;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif">You can check order status and inventory, estimate shipping, create a virtual sample or access case studies, test reports, images and templates. It&rsquo;s all there!</span></span></span>
 <br/>
 <br/>

    
<span style="font-size:11px"><b><span style="line-height:.7;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:black">CONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE</span></b><br />
<span style="line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;,sans-serif;color:black">This electronic message is confidential and may contain legally privileged information intended only for the use of the individual
or company named above. If the reader of this message is not the intended recipient, or the employee or agent responsible
to deliver it to the intended recipient, you are hereby notified&nbsp; that any dissemination, distribution or copying of this communication
is strictly prohibited. If you have received this communication in error, please immediately notify us by telephone, and
return the original message to us at the address&nbsp;above.</span> </span>

</html>
    </messaging:htmlEmailBody>

</messaging:emailTemplate>